div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pitagora-202000.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 41vw" width="753" alt="image background" srcset="/assets/images/final/pitagora-202000-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/pitagora-202000.png 700w" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/cal-20tech-201967-20-20s.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/cal-20tech-201967-20-20s-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/cal-20tech-201967-20-20s.png 563w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 65vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 47vw, 21vw" class="featured-image image-size-margin"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_11d611f7-81cf-739d-6b37-8ca9a54ac473-9cb79b72" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Prvi pravi digitalni kalkulator koji je za sve kalkulatorske funkcije upotrebljavao četiri LSI integrirana kruga bio je Sharp QT?8D iz 1969. godine. <br/><br/>Prvi džepni kalkulator je bio prototip nazvan Cal Tech iz 1967. godine kompanije Texas Instruments.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_8e4f8302-5c96-b0c3-d33d-af6d6cb40e3c-9cb79b72" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium hide-heading3">Od skupog do besplatnog<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Kroz veći dio povijesti kalkulatori su bili vrlo skupocjeni uređaji. <br/><br/>Na primjer, 1956. godine Olivettijev mehanički kalkulator Divisumma 24 koštao je 325.000 lira, dok je novi Fiat 500 Nuova koštao 465.000 lira. </div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Od skupog do besplatnog<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/03-20vaga.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/03-20vaga-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/03-20vaga.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 94vw, 44vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/olivetti_divisumma_24_3.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/olivetti_divisumma_24_3-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/olivetti_divisumma_24_3.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 94vw, 31vw" class="featured-image image-size-mob-bigger"/></div></div><div id="w-node-c7279672-c948-95c9-d51b-727f4d7c1815-9cb79b72" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">Masovna proizvodnja čipova i nepoštedna borba za tržišni udio doveli su 1980-ih do drastičnog smanjenja cijena, a danas kalkulator dobijete kao besplatnu aplikaciju za mobitel ili osobno računalo.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
